{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43545","headline":"重阳夜集兰陵居与宣上人联句 · 李益","name":"重阳夜集兰陵居与宣上人联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蟋蟀催寒服，茱萸滴露房。\n酒巡明刻烛，篱菊暗寻芳。\n新月和秋露，繁星混夜霜。\n登高今夕事，九九是天长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43545.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43545","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}